Subject: [PATCH 2/5] =?UTF-8?q?feat(frontend):=20a=C3=B1adir=20servidor=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?est=C3=A1tico=20endurecido=20con=20CSP=20y=20configuraci=C3=B3n?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20en=20tiempo=20de=20ejecuci=C3=B3n?=
